  "duration_s": 95.339002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。思李啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。这偶是好藕啊，就是心眼太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜呀。来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。领导，饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的，运气了不喝，就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，能酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不，今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。哈哈哈啊，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。来就来带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯，听这意思。领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯关注我，每天学点儿高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 1230,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1490,
      "end_ms": 2970,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3370,
      "end_ms": 4410,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4450,
      "end_ms": 5890,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5950,
      "end_ms": 7690,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9130,
      "end_ms": 10570,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10850,
      "end_ms": 12410,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12710,
      "end_ms": 13910,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14110,
      "end_ms": 15350,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18210,
      "end_ms": 18830,
      "text": "思李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19350,
      "end_ms": 21210,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21730,
      "end_ms": 23750,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23930,
      "end_ms": 25830,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27070,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "这偶是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28770,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "就是心眼太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31040,
      "end_ms": 32740,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00017",
      "start_ms": 32980,
      "end_ms": 34400,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36180,
      "end_ms": 38360,
      "text": "来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38560,
      "end_ms": 38960,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39060,
      "end_ms": 40120,
      "text": "饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40320,
      "end_ms": 42260,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42400,
      "end_ms": 43340,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43340,
      "end_ms": 45680,
      "text": "运气了不喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00024",
      "start_ms": 46580,
      "end_ms": 47720,
      "text": "就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00025",
      "start_ms": 48460,
      "end_ms": 48860,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49320,
      "end_ms": 50520,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50780,
      "end_ms": 51780,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53840,
      "end_ms": 55200,
      "text": "能酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00029",
      "start_ms": 55460,
      "end_ms": 55820,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55820,
      "end_ms": 56800,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56800,
      "end_ms": 57940,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58180,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "这不，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00033",
      "start_ms": 58420,
      "end_ms": 59620,
      "text": "今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00034",
      "start_ms": 59620,
      "end_ms": 59915,
      "text": "高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00035",
      "start_ms": 60230,
      "end_ms": 61425,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61910,
      "end_ms": 62910,
      "text": "哈哈哈啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00037",
      "start_ms": 63030,
      "end_ms": 64355,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00038",
      "start_ms": 65050,
      "end_ms": 67050,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00039",
      "start_ms": 67050,
      "end_ms": 69485,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00040",
      "start_ms": 71700,
      "end_ms": 73180,
      "text": "来就来带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00041",
      "start_ms": 73180,
      "end_ms": 73920,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00042",
      "start_ms": 74040,
      "end_ms": 74460,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00043",
      "start_ms": 74580,
      "end_ms": 75180,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00044",
      "start_ms": 75180,
      "end_ms": 75780,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00045",
      "start_ms": 75900,
      "end_ms": 77260,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00046",
      "start_ms": 77340,
      "end_ms": 79545,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00047",
      "start_ms": 80710,
      "end_ms": 81110,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00048",
      "start_ms": 81110,
      "end_ms": 82315,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00049",
      "start_ms": 82590,
      "end_ms": 84410,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00050",
      "start_ms": 84450,
      "end_ms": 85690,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00051",
      "start_ms": 85730,
      "end_ms": 86330,
      "text": "听这意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00052",
      "start_ms": 86330,
      "end_ms": 87430,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00053",
      "start_ms": 87450,
      "end_ms": 90630,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00054",
      "start_ms": 90850,
      "end_ms": 92290,
      "text": "每天学点儿高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00055",
      "start_ms": 92290,
      "end_ms": 93085,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06af657ac35dd3a7_s00056",
      "start_ms": 93430,
      "end_ms": 95115,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
